      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hey, hey. I have an update now. I repro'd the bug. It actually does also affect the OSC Debug Menu.\n\nSteps:\n\n1. Open either Debug Menus\n\n2. Grab Menu, play with it for a bit\n\n3. For a bit more clarity, close the debug menu while grabbing it.\n\n4. Reopen Debug Menu\n\nIt either won't be in view, or will be out of reach. The Debug Menu is world anchored, and does not respawn to viewpoint.",
