  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I found this bug on Quest beta 1357.  This issue is also probably found on the PCVR version.\n\nWhen I load in the debug console found in the action menu, it will appear, however when I close and reopen it, it does not appear again.\n\n This issue does appear to be affecting the OSC debug console. Switching and resetting avatars does not fix this bug. Rejoining the world or switching instances does not fix the bug either.",
